      "Frequently asked questions",
      "<strong>The shortcut does nothing?</strong> Make sure PasteNest is running, then try the menu bar icon. Check the current combination in Settings → Shortcuts and whether another app is using it.",
      "<strong>A new copy is missing?</strong> Check that recording is not paused. PasteNest records copies made while it is running; it does not recover your entire clipboard history from before launch.",
